  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "c5d7b253-65cb-4ab6-b5d8-b0b465a9daca",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue o espanhol ao que a pessoa sente agora.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a0df354a-d6a6-4b0c-9a72-df89a5fcfaf7",
          "textContent": "<p>Ela está esperando a entrevista e o foco é o estado de agora.</p><p><strong>Hoy está nerviosa.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Hoje ela está nervosa.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/3056364c3b1341b8914d0a22c795c744_l04b01-mujer-nerviosa-entrevista.png?Expires=1794099517&Signature=Ng5BK-XwUov6EkUZu4fHtpWFA-4UJ~GXWvrlVmpM~A95yMux71zZsnzzKWoWoySENLnDoLKMGJslvLxMQRl2DbwuzT8BJvJ~qPoO3ut2koMi4uDdBPP4fAttejYcBC0LJhZDXZPxgnYmtKVUTXa5RbtsbGz66PDJ5Y7pvjcD6d5f-k5O4vU1Rt64gxh91rcLKeqUMyawaLo2VdDCwllH3lwl28fMnqun8-KCnyXW-V8chY8Nx7tArXQU~r0DtEYL8EebF2xE3loIxp20w7-nYvyL1-ejyOkAwGSO7IGFivNUxyK4R6t7vpjjzt2qDvFdrRBXqVYO04n1M7AmKjGuUA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/60d684f29de94d9b9d7c4c5b47c1367f_l04b01-hoy-esta-nerviosa.mp3?Expires=1794099517&Signature=arF6xO8eonD5t~Y4iYbWMTKbDJAFo7lZMjAeSnMWvaEtA9hRZLtEh3Jg8pEWbsoFQm0ylrek9gQ6tl3K5ZNXPIaTb1Y02wDyvLHwuMp3GYlWsKs4ega0KFZo8H~rTAgTvsqdz3680l3CBuHkef0H0jRvkCEPpWF2l8A1BInIOFLkDZ9bh3ah~AhHAFfHcNooxuS3v~eJPo84jXNHtbhn4d3D2fzaNZL5FKPV-47FkL~fkLxr6G0Pxo3UmtbHSzv5qkBn3sxpQ0IAsW4k66CwGpslrVLKGpJMDlM97F0vaL9Y6PNnnM4eeYUNX2qEDndH56Lk3kB23T5p3fcZUm66Dw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
